1
00:00:21,440 --> 00:00:22,680
(Silence; Operating Room Area)

2
00:00:39,680 --> 00:00:43,560
=Stand Up for Love=

3
00:00:43,720 --> 00:00:46,680
=Episode 4=

4
00:00:50,640 --> 00:00:51,679
Mr. Zhang.

5
00:00:51,719 --> 00:00:52,719
Let go of me.

6
00:00:53,359 --> 00:00:54,880
You got rid of the scar so perfectly.

7
00:00:55,240 --> 00:00:56,039
Impressive.

8
00:00:56,600 --> 00:00:57,920
That's nonsense.

9
00:00:57,920 --> 00:00:59,719
I don't know what you're talking about.

10
00:00:59,960 --> 00:01:00,640
Jiang Lai.

11
00:01:01,679 --> 00:01:02,560
Who is Jiang Lai?

12
00:01:02,560 --> 00:01:03,920
My name is Zhao Ke.

13
00:01:04,560 --> 00:01:06,079
After sleeping with you for so long,

14
00:01:06,159 --> 00:01:07,879
do you really think you can
still fool me?

15
00:01:13,439 --> 00:01:14,280
Mr. Zhang,

16
00:01:14,640 --> 00:01:16,319
even though you're a rising star
in the business world,

17
00:01:16,359 --> 00:01:17,920
I'm not someone you can humiliate
however you please.

18
00:01:18,079 --> 00:01:19,000
This slap

19
00:01:19,439 --> 00:01:20,840
is the price you pay for insulting me.

20
00:01:21,439 --> 00:01:22,239
(Zhao Ke!)

21
00:01:22,920 --> 00:01:23,719
(Zhao Ke!)

22
00:01:23,840 --> 00:01:24,879
Ms. Lin.

23
00:01:25,159 --> 00:01:26,120
I'll be done soon.

24
00:01:29,599 --> 00:01:30,959
(The bait has been set.)

25
00:01:31,319 --> 00:01:32,480
(The greedy prey)

26
00:01:33,040 --> 00:01:34,879
(will eventually walk right
into the trap.)

27
00:01:43,359 --> 00:01:44,079
Ms. Lin.

28
00:01:44,439 --> 00:01:46,200
I've cleaned the bathtub.

29
00:01:46,319 --> 00:01:47,400
And everything has been put away.

30
00:01:47,400 --> 00:01:49,200
You look rather plain,

31
00:01:49,519 --> 00:01:51,120
but you do work efficiently.

32
00:01:52,200 --> 00:01:54,040
Do my makeup tomorrow morning.

33
00:01:54,439 --> 00:01:57,040
You can stay in the guest room tonight.

34
00:01:57,200 --> 00:01:59,120
Okay. I'll leave now.

35
00:02:01,159 --> 00:02:01,959
Baby.

36
00:02:05,439 --> 00:02:05,920
What is that scent?

37
00:02:05,920 --> 00:02:06,680
Do you like it?

38
00:02:07,280 --> 00:02:07,959
I do.

39
00:02:09,240 --> 00:02:10,319
I love it.

40
00:02:26,400 --> 00:02:29,120
Baby, I saw a news story today.

41
00:02:29,360 --> 00:02:30,840
It was about a girl
who donated her kidney

42
00:02:30,840 --> 00:02:32,520
only to be framed by the recipient.

43
00:02:32,960 --> 00:02:34,039
They claimed she had some
kind of mental illness

44
00:02:34,039 --> 00:02:35,439
and even had her sent
to a psychiatric hospital.

45
00:02:35,439 --> 00:02:37,840
That girl must have had something
wrong with her.

46
00:02:38,199 --> 00:02:39,599
Otherwise,

47
00:02:39,719 --> 00:02:41,159
why would someone frame her
for no reason?

48
00:02:44,039 --> 00:02:44,759
Right?

49
00:02:45,159 --> 00:02:46,439
My baby is right.

50
00:02:46,639 --> 00:02:47,560
Tomorrow morning,

51
00:02:47,560 --> 00:02:47,800
Tomorrow morning,

52
00:02:48,039 --> 00:02:50,039
I'm going to attend an event
with my mother.

53
00:02:50,120 --> 00:02:51,039
I'll take you there.

54
00:02:52,020 --> 00:02:52,340
Okay.

55
00:03:07,760 --> 00:03:08,920
(Calling Zhao Mai)

56
00:03:09,039 --> 00:03:10,199
Miss Zhao, where are you?

57
00:03:10,639 --> 00:03:11,800
Something doesn't feel right.

58
00:03:11,919 --> 00:03:13,240
A car has been following me.

59
00:03:13,240 --> 00:03:14,199
Let's meet.

60
00:03:14,960 --> 00:03:15,520
Okay.

61
00:03:27,680 --> 00:03:28,840
You asked to meet so suddenly.

62
00:03:29,000 --> 00:03:30,159
Did something happen?

63
00:03:30,759 --> 00:03:32,360
I want to talk it through with you

64
00:03:32,680 --> 00:03:34,000
about how to deal with Zhang Haotian.

65
00:03:34,280 --> 00:03:35,840
I know you're eager for revenge,

66
00:03:35,879 --> 00:03:37,639
but Zhang Haotian
is extremely calculating.

67
00:03:37,840 --> 00:03:39,000
You just moved into the Lin family home.

68
00:03:39,360 --> 00:03:40,800
Don't do anything illegal.

69
00:03:40,960 --> 00:03:42,840
The problem is, the moment
Zhang Haotian sees this face of mine,

70
00:03:42,840 --> 00:03:44,120
he'll think of Jiang Lai.

71
00:03:44,479 --> 00:03:46,039
He'll become suspicious of me.

72
00:03:46,280 --> 00:03:47,680
I won't be able to make a move.

73
00:03:48,360 --> 00:03:50,280
Zhang Haotian is far too suspicious.

74
00:03:50,759 --> 00:03:52,000
I'm worried you'll be in danger.

75
00:03:52,360 --> 00:03:54,400
Seeing you deceived
and hurt so badly back then

76
00:03:54,479 --> 00:03:56,039
still scares me.

77
00:03:56,319 --> 00:03:57,960
I'm afraid you'll do anything

78
00:03:58,000 --> 00:03:59,360
and end up hurt all over again.

79
00:03:59,919 --> 00:04:01,479
I know what I'm doing.

80
00:04:01,879 --> 00:04:03,960
I have my own plans.

81
00:04:04,759 --> 00:04:05,919
I want to

82
00:04:05,919 --> 00:04:07,280
get close to him.

83
00:04:07,360 --> 00:04:08,280
That way, it'll be easier to gather
evidence and bring him down.

84
00:04:08,280 --> 00:04:09,439
That way, it'll be easier to gather
evidence and bring him down.

85
00:04:10,159 --> 00:04:12,759
Alright. I'll handle gathering
information from the outside

86
00:04:12,759 --> 00:04:14,280
and prepare an emergency escape route.

87
00:04:14,280 --> 00:04:16,439
Call me anytime if anything happens.

88
00:04:20,160 --> 00:04:20,959
Mr. Zhang.

89
00:04:21,879 --> 00:04:22,839
Why are you avoiding me?

90
00:04:24,920 --> 00:04:26,360
Why would I avoid you?

91
00:04:27,720 --> 00:04:30,360
Shouldn't you already know the reason?

92
00:04:30,839 --> 00:04:32,079
Otherwise, why would you be

93
00:04:33,079 --> 00:04:34,240
trying so hard to avoid me?

94
00:04:34,519 --> 00:04:36,360
Mr. Zhang, you are

95
00:04:36,360 --> 00:04:37,680
the husband of my employer, Ms. Lin.

96
00:04:38,160 --> 00:04:39,759
Other than matters concerning Ms. Lin,

97
00:04:39,759 --> 00:04:41,360
there's nothing else for us to discuss.

98
00:04:41,519 --> 00:04:43,120
That would go against
my professional ethics.

99
00:04:44,879 --> 00:04:45,759
Take your time.

100
00:04:58,360 --> 00:04:59,439
Mr. Zhang.

101
00:05:01,560 --> 00:05:02,519
What are you doing?

102
00:05:05,879 --> 00:05:08,360
Mr. Zhang, Ms. Lin loves you so much.

103
00:05:09,360 --> 00:05:10,560
You can't do this to her.

104
00:05:22,879 --> 00:05:23,600
Ms. Zhao.

105
00:05:25,319 --> 00:05:26,120
Lulu.

106
00:05:30,319 --> 00:05:30,920
Lulu.

107
00:05:31,720 --> 00:05:33,680
This woman went to great lengths
to get close to you.

108
00:05:33,920 --> 00:05:34,920
So this was all for...

109
00:05:35,120 --> 00:05:36,160
She was trying to seduce me.

110
00:05:36,160 --> 00:05:37,079
I didn't!

111
00:05:37,759 --> 00:05:38,560
I didn't!

112
00:05:42,240 --> 00:05:43,079
I didn't!

113
00:05:43,399 --> 00:05:45,439
Mr. Zhang followed me to the guest room.

114
00:05:45,439 --> 00:05:46,720
There are security cameras
in your living room.

115
00:05:46,720 --> 00:05:47,920
You can check the footage.

116
00:05:49,079 --> 00:05:50,759
You want me to check the footage?

117
00:05:51,319 --> 00:05:52,079
Zhao Ke.

118
00:05:52,240 --> 00:05:54,360
Don't you think you're overestimating
your own worth?

119
00:05:54,360 --> 00:05:54,879
Baby.

120
00:05:55,000 --> 00:05:56,120
Let go of me. Let go!

121
00:05:56,120 --> 00:05:56,759
Calm down.

122
00:05:56,879 --> 00:05:57,360
Calm down.

123
00:05:57,360 --> 00:05:58,759
You want me to calm down?

124
00:06:00,279 --> 00:06:04,319
She seduced you, kissed you, touched
you, and held you in my own house.

125
00:06:04,319 --> 00:06:05,279
Why should I calm down?

126
00:06:05,279 --> 00:06:06,160
I'm not calming down!

127
00:06:06,160 --> 00:06:06,959
Alright, baby.

128
00:06:07,639 --> 00:06:08,920
We'll just throw her out.

129
00:06:09,480 --> 00:06:11,560
Don't let this hurt you, okay?

130
00:06:12,439 --> 00:06:14,279
Please. I can't stand seeing you upset.

131
00:06:19,920 --> 00:06:20,720
Ms. Lin.

132
00:06:20,720 --> 00:06:22,560
That wretched woman Zhao Ke,

133
00:06:22,560 --> 00:06:23,920
I want her blacklisted
across the entire industry.

134
00:06:23,920 --> 00:06:25,079
It's really not what you think.

135
00:06:25,079 --> 00:06:25,759
Get lost!

136
00:06:27,759 --> 00:06:29,319
Get out!

137
00:06:34,360 --> 00:06:35,480
Don't be angry.

138
00:06:38,240 --> 00:06:39,519
Wash yourself clean.

139
00:06:39,560 --> 00:06:41,160
Wash every place

140
00:06:41,160 --> 00:06:42,279
that woman touched.

141
00:06:42,279 --> 00:06:44,160
Alright, I'll do it.

142
00:06:44,519 --> 00:06:45,759
Don't get your hands dirty.

143
00:06:46,879 --> 00:06:48,040
But please don't be angry.

144
00:06:49,319 --> 00:06:51,759
(As long as Jiang Lai stays out
of Lin Lulu's sight,)

145
00:06:52,040 --> 00:06:54,560
(I'll find a way to make her disappear.)

146
00:06:56,279 --> 00:06:59,319
(This face will always remind
Zhang Haotian of Jiang Lai.)

147
00:06:59,839 --> 00:07:01,680
(I have to make Zhang Haotian believe)

148
00:07:01,680 --> 00:07:02,439
(that I am Zhao Ke,)

149
00:07:02,639 --> 00:07:03,680
(not Jiang Lai.)

150
00:07:04,600 --> 00:07:06,439
(Jiang Lai was gentle and kind.)

151
00:07:06,680 --> 00:07:08,199
(I'll be bold and untamed.)

152
00:07:08,759 --> 00:07:09,879
(She gave him her heart,)

153
00:07:10,079 --> 00:07:11,560
(while I'll make every move
with a purpose.)

154
00:07:11,759 --> 00:07:12,759
(Zhang Haotian,)

155
00:07:12,959 --> 00:07:14,800
(you toyed with my love,)

156
00:07:14,959 --> 00:07:16,319
(and trampled on my dignity.)

157
00:07:16,920 --> 00:07:18,519
(Now I'll fake my devotion)

158
00:07:18,639 --> 00:07:20,480
(until you fall completely for Zhao Ke.)

159
00:07:20,959 --> 00:07:23,399
(I'll make you taste what it's like)

160
00:07:24,120 --> 00:07:25,800
(to have your love betrayed
and your world shattered.)

161
00:07:44,880 --> 00:07:45,880
(Waitress)

162
00:08:01,240 --> 00:08:02,120
Please wait a moment.

163
00:08:02,120 --> 00:08:03,240
I'll deliver a drink over there first.

164
00:08:03,240 --> 00:08:04,360
I'll be right back.

165
00:08:07,920 --> 00:08:08,959
Hello, sir.

166
00:08:08,959 --> 00:08:09,920
Here's your drink.

167
00:08:09,920 --> 00:08:10,639
Miss.

168
00:08:10,840 --> 00:08:13,360
(VIP Booth 2)

169
00:08:13,439 --> 00:08:15,279
I'm working right now, sir.

170
00:08:15,600 --> 00:08:17,399
What about when you're off work?

171
00:08:18,199 --> 00:08:19,839
Would it be okay when you're off work?

172
00:08:19,840 --> 00:08:21,360
(VIP Booth 2)

173
00:08:22,600 --> 00:08:24,759
I'm not that kind of frivolous girl.

174
00:08:26,120 --> 00:08:27,519
How could you call that frivolous?

175
00:08:27,519 --> 00:08:29,040
That's called love at first sight.

176
00:08:29,720 --> 00:08:32,080
No, I can't. It's my first day at work.

177
00:08:32,080 --> 00:08:34,159
My boss will punish me if I do that.

178
00:08:42,159 --> 00:08:43,159
(Jiang Lai.)

179
00:08:44,240 --> 00:08:46,200
(Let's see how long
you can keep pretending.)

180
00:08:46,919 --> 00:08:48,039
I really can't.

181
00:08:50,320 --> 00:08:52,160
(VIP Booth 2)

182
00:09:01,039 --> 00:09:02,080
(Jiang Lai.)

183
00:09:02,200 --> 00:09:05,000
(You shameless woman.)

184
00:09:06,080 --> 00:09:07,640
(Endless Love)

185
00:09:11,600 --> 00:09:13,399
I'll make it up to you properly
at the hotel.

186
00:09:14,320 --> 00:09:14,919
Let's go.

187
00:09:17,600 --> 00:09:18,399
Be careful.

188
00:09:21,080 --> 00:09:21,879
Take it slow.

189
00:09:30,320 --> 00:09:31,399
Let me tell you,

190
00:09:31,720 --> 00:09:34,799
I booked the river-view suite
at Pinghu Hotel.

191
00:09:36,399 --> 00:09:38,399
(902)
Do you always bring girls here?

192
00:09:38,399 --> 00:09:40,080
No. You're the only one
I've brought here.

193
00:09:40,080 --> 00:09:41,320
I don't believe you.

194
00:09:41,879 --> 00:09:43,799
(903)
Really. You'll believe me soon.

195
00:09:43,800 --> 00:09:46,880
(906)

196
00:09:52,400 --> 00:09:54,680
(906)

197
00:09:57,880 --> 00:10:01,679
(906)

198
00:10:01,679 --> 00:10:02,720
(Why are you in such a hurry?)

199
00:10:02,720 --> 00:10:04,480
(A night like this is priceless.)

200
00:10:04,799 --> 00:10:07,360
(Don't touch me. I'm ticklish.)

201
00:10:07,679 --> 00:10:08,639
(I'll do it myself.)

202
00:10:25,920 --> 00:10:28,040
♪Whatever happens♪

203
00:10:29,280 --> 00:10:31,480
♪God knows I tried♪

204
00:10:32,960 --> 00:10:36,000
♪No angels watching tonight♪

205
00:10:39,640 --> 00:10:41,680
♪Hand on a weapon♪

206
00:10:43,120 --> 00:10:45,440
♪Devil in sight♪

207
00:10:46,600 --> 00:10:49,840
♪Turning the water to wine♪

208
00:11:05,400 --> 00:11:08,720
♪Ain't no fire, fire♪

209
00:11:09,400 --> 00:11:11,640
♪That burns you like the cold♪

210
00:11:12,480 --> 00:11:15,360
♪Ain't no fire, fire♪

211
00:11:16,160 --> 00:11:18,600
♪Can hurt you like your own♪

212
00:11:19,200 --> 00:11:24,160
♪So, I let it burn, burn♪

213
00:11:36,120 --> 00:11:38,200
(How could I have such thoughts
about her?)

214
00:11:50,799 --> 00:11:53,440
(Jiang Lai has never slept
with anyone else.)

215
00:11:54,960 --> 00:11:57,000
(Waiting for the Prey)

216
00:11:58,040 --> 00:12:01,920
♪Listen, the wind chimes softly whisper♪

217
00:12:02,000 --> 00:12:04,800
♪I should forget you♪

218
00:12:05,640 --> 00:12:10,040
♪But I have the will,
yet not the strength♪

219
00:12:10,480 --> 00:12:12,000
♪To carry on♪

220
00:12:12,880 --> 00:12:17,240
♪The scenery you once longed to see♪

221
00:12:18,000 --> 00:12:20,920
♪You no longer have the strength♪

222
00:12:22,360 --> 00:12:25,720
♪You want me to go there for you♪

223
00:12:26,560 --> 00:12:31,880
♪I look up and see a hollow sky♪

224
00:12:32,200 --> 00:12:36,040
♪Your freedom♪

225
00:12:36,720 --> 00:12:41,520
♪Has become my cage♪

226
00:12:42,240 --> 00:12:48,320
♪My hand brushes over your smile
in the photograph♪

227
00:12:48,640 --> 00:12:54,440
♪This glass of wine is filled
with sorrow♪

228
00:12:55,760 --> 00:13:01,840
♪I look up at the beautiful night sky♪

229
00:13:01,880 --> 00:13:04,720
♪You told me♪

230
00:13:04,720 --> 00:13:09,880
♪I would shine like a star♪

231
00:13:10,960 --> 00:13:14,920
♪But you forgot to teach me♪

232
00:13:14,920 --> 00:13:18,560
♪How to live without you♪

233
00:13:18,800 --> 00:13:22,960
♪I look up♪

234
00:13:22,960 --> 00:13:25,720
♪The starry sky♪

235
00:13:26,040 --> 00:13:29,520
♪So hazy and blurred♪
